{"id":"n20207-1-23","stage":1,"title":"방학 · 放假","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20207-1-23-1","ko":"방학 때 뭘 하고 지낼 거니?","zh":"假期你打算做些什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지낼","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3dbe133d14200f2dfca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20207-1-23-2","ko":"이번 방학 때는 시골에 있는 할머니 댁에 갈 생각이야.","zh":"这次假期我打算去乡下奶奶家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때는","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시골에","meaning":"乡下，农村，乡村","explanation":"시골：乡下，农村，乡村；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시골","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62488","senseId":"1","lemma":"시골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할머니","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"댁에","meaning":"府，贵府","explanation":"댁：府，贵府；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"댁","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64392","senseId":"1","lemma":"댁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이야.","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"8d3efc29ac663a71","term":"시골","zh":"乡下，农村，乡村","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3","entryId":"62488","definition":"离城市较远、人口稀少且开发不充分的地区。","pronunciation":["시골"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"1ad485c2f73968fd","term":"댁","zh":"府，贵府","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3","entryId":"64392","definition":"(敬语)别人的家或家庭。","pronunciation":["댁"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef472d980a9081be3005.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.82,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20207","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9869,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["假期你打算做些什么呢？","这次假期我打算去乡下奶奶家。","怎么买了这么多东西啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["假期你打算做些什么呢？","这次假期我打算去乡下奶奶家。","怎么买了这么多东西啊？"],"answer":1}]}
